# Collection version pinning

Do **not** change `galaxy.yml` `version` (or bump `infra-ado-*.tar.gz` release numbers) unless the user explicitly asks to bump the version.

- Keep shipping fixes under the **current** version (rebuild/replace the same tarball).
- Never get ahead of what is on main by inventing a newer version.
- Force Hub republish of the same version is fine; a version bump is a deliberate release decision by the user.
